+        With sigma pinned to 1 the residual (a_hat - x0) equals (v - v_hat), so
+        this operates directly on the velocity residual. sigma is a per-sample
+        scalar from a zero-init linear head on the (detached) prediction, so it
+        starts at softplus(sbias) and learns the residual scale without letting
+        the mean path game it.
